    "bbox": [
      62.64,
      374.4,
      554.43,
      396.47
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of Powers vested to me by section 32(1) of the Provincial Council Act. No. 42 of 1987, I, M. P. Jayasinghe, Governorof Uva Province do hereby notify that the following appointments have been approved by me.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      94.08,
      415.2,
      555.11,
      485.27
    ],
    "text": "1)Mr. H. P. A. G. Anuruddha, Grade III officer of the Sri Lanka Administrative Service, to perform the Duties of theSecretary to the Ministry of Health, Indigenous Medicine, Probation and Childcare, Women's Affairs and Powerand Energy of the Uva Provincial Council, in addition to his duties of permanent post, from the date 16.07.2017till the return to the Island of Mr. L. L. Anil Wijesiri, the Secretary to the Ministry of Health, IndigenousMedicine, Probation and Childcare, Women's Affairs and Power and Energy of the Uva Provincial Council, Whois abroad from the date 16.07.2017 to 24.07.2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      94.08,
      504.0,
      555.35,
      550.07
    ],
    "text": "2)Mr. R. M. Dayarathne, Class III officer of the Sri Lanka Planning Service, to perform the duties of the DeputyChief Secretary (Planning) of the Uva Provincial Council, in addition to his duties of permanent post, from thedate 16.07.2017 till the return to the Island of Mr. M. M. Ananda Wijitha Kumara, the Deputy Chief Secretary(Planning) of the Uva Provincial Council, Who is abroad from the date 16.07.2017 to 24.07.2017.",
